"Gate": {
  "index": 0,
  "category": "rituals",
  "tier": 4,
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Ritual of the Gate"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This ritual will find a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Waystone",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " with the matching rune combination and open a short-lived portal to it. \n\nStepping through the portal will teleport me instantly to that location. \n\nUnlike the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of Return",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", this portal will remain open until a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Rune of Marking",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " is thrown into it. \n\nOptionally, adding a dye to the center will change the color of the portal. \n\nRemember, "
        },
        {
          "text": "a portal will never teleport a sneaking target",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nIf I replace the dye with a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Greater Ender Mote ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the portal will open and will teleport those that walk through it to a random position."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
